#: source/nijigenerate/utils/crashdump.d:514
#: native/src/nijigenerate/utils/crashdump_posix_notify.cpp:30
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"===   nijigenerate has crashed   ===\n"
"Please send us the nijigenerate-crashdump.txt file in your log directory, "
"XDG_STATE_HOME. For Flatpak, this is in ~/.var/app/"
"nijigenerate.nijigenerate.\n"
"Attach the file as a git issue @ https://github.com/nijigenerate/"
"nijigenerate/issues"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"===   nijigenerate se ha cerrado inesperadamente  ===\n"
"Por favor envíanos el archivo nijigenerate-crashdump.txt que se encuentra en "
"el directorio XDG_STATE_HOME. En el caso de Flatpak, se encuentra en ~/.var/"
"app/nijigenerate.nijigenerate.\n"
"Adjunta el archivo como un issue de git en https://github.com/nijigenerate/"
"nijigenerate/issues"

